## Canonical bundles

- `roles_bound`: normalized `ndf.workflow.yaml` roles block
- `synthesis_dispatch`: valid cycle + DESIGN_MAP draft
- `architecture_review`: cycle SHA + DESIGN_MAP SHA
- `design_dispatch`: approved DESIGN_MAP → spec/00–50
- `trunk_approval`: Foundation + draft spec + baseline refs (greenfield)
- `genesis_review`: Genesis DEC + NDF tree SHA + Trunk SHA + verification evidence
